  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0: aligned with Caveman.PrivacyGuard 1.3.0. New tools: mask_stream (boundary-safe streaming PII masking over an array of text chunks, with a configurable overlap window), mask_document (streaming masking of plain-text/Markdown/CSV files into a name.masked.ext copy, original never overwritten), and session_summary (redacted placeholder+category view of a session — never the original value). 1.2.2 added 5 new country validators, AI Act/NIS2 compliance flags, PrivacySessionManager, AiTransparencyNotice and ChatIntentRouter.",
